  "ingredients": [
    "2 cups all-purpose flour",
    "1 cup butter",
    "0.5 cup water",
    "1.5 cups almond paste",
    "2 eggs",
    "0.75 cup white sugar",
    "0.25 teaspoon almond extract",
    "1 pinch salt",
    "1 egg white, beaten"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Place flour in a large bowl; cut in cold butter with a pastry cutter or two knives until mixture has a crumb-like texture. Make a well in the center; add cold water. Mix together to forms a dough. Try not to overmix. Chill dough.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/agExp3v34-3t_cQvRiHicPa9Hu0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11433-banket-VAT-step-01-191f59d0b5c74d8ba0aa5b137ed2b184.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11433/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, preheat the oven to 450 degrees F (225 degrees C). Grease cookie sheets.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wWFFP4BFjjgUMi5jNk9N1Xf2bmc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11433-banket-VAT-step-02-85200d89ccc144598fd176c22210ba6f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11433/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Blend almond paste, eggs, 3/4 cup sugar, almond extract, and salt together in a medium bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/RpL3OmfNseiORmBo2E9hm3jGAxM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11433-banket-VAT-step-03-54fa23c87beb4a9db3d290fd6e8385a5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11433/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide dough into 4 equal pieces; roll out into 15-inch strips. Place filling along the center of each long strip of dough.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9Aeb0f4chrW_YxFDTz3VEqDQrQA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11433-banket-VAT-step-04-506b26d5073f49f68f0132b4a4a78374.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11433/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll up, and pinch the ends to seal. Place strips 2 inches apart on cookie sheet. Brush with egg white, and sprinkle with sugar.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ijNl1wB4wYlOnFA-56F2bTkhXWg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11433-banket-VAT-step-05-8076c65634cc4125846aba086496f7b2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11433/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until golden, about 15 to 20 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4X22SUZInArx9_ZZNgc-c1i96kY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11433-banket-VAT-step-06-7edbecd1a5e84fa09d5e4aacffa1859e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11433/step_06.webp"
    }
